---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="container temp">
    <h1>呜 ... 施工中 🚧</h1>
    <p>嗯？不对，就算施工好了我也没什么东西可以有文档啊 🤔</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>



<style>
  .container {
    max-width: var(--container-page);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .temp {
    /* Start below the site-wide banner band (.site-bg in BaseLayout). */
    margin: calc(var(--banner-h) + 3rem) auto;
  }

  .temp h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
</style>